## Notes / Limitations

This is an **ideal transmission-line** matching design used to study the gain/noise/match trade-space cleanly. A layout-ready version would add substrate-backed physical lines (microstrip/CPW), losses, discontinuities, stability across a wider band, and a full bias network + EM-aware validation.
